<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When alone, You’re my song.</l><l>In my weakness, Lord, You are strong.</l><l>When there’s doubt then, as faith You come.</l><l>Now I have hope, You’re the One.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In the storms, You’re the calm.</l><l>In my pain, Lord, You are the balm.</l><l>In self-pity, as light You’ll shine,</l><l>Filling me with love divine.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Praising You, is my joy.</l><l>You’re the pure One, without alloy,</l><l>Showing me, Lord, Your wondrous love,</l><l>When You came down, from above.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Now in me, all in all,</l><l>For this living, Your Name I’ll call.</l><l>O Lord Jesus, for growth I’ll pray.</l><l>By Your Spirit, that’s the way.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
